  "description": "The Hover-1 Journey Max doubles the power of the baseline Hover-1 Journey with its 700W dual motor setup and provides a thrilling ride experience. With a dual motor e-scooter like Journey Max, you can power through steeper hills without losing speed and feel a greater rush of acceleration every time you engage the throttle, much more than you ever could with a single motor e-scooter. Journey Max’s wider, longer foot deck provides more standing room and comfort for long trips. A high performance rear disc brake provides excellent stopping power. The upgraded LED display is more visible in bright daylight conditions, and the revamped two-part folding mechanism and safety latch reinforces steering column stability. Ride faster and travel further with a top speed of 19 mph and 26 miles of range. Feel the rush with the Hover-1 Journey Max.",
